Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] Load window: a grid view with each park's preview

The file browser's customize menu gets List view and Grid view (config
value file_browser_grid_view). In grid view each file is a tile with a
reduced copy of its embedded preview, the kind the preview setting asks for
(screenshot or minimap), and its name below; folders show their icon.
Hovering a tile fills the preview pane as hovering a row does.

Previews of the visible tiles are read one at a time on the background
worker and kept for the session (up to 512, keyed by path and modification
time); their image slots are allocated while the window shows them and freed
when it closes. Track designs and heightmaps keep the list.
